        <h2 class="text-center" style="color: #004080; font-weight: bold;">Clarity of Online Election Results in Pakistan</h2>
        <p class="text-center" style="color: #333; font-size: 16px;">
            The online election results system in Pakistan ensures transparency, eliminating any possibilities of cheating or manipulation. The process involves multiple layers of security and verification. This guarantees the public that the election results are authentic and free of any fraud or tampering. The following diagram illustrates the smooth, reliable, and secure process of online elections in Pakistan.
        </p>
    </div>
