        <p style="color: #333; font-size: 16px;">
            The diagram above shows the clear steps in the election process, starting from voter registration, to casting votes, and finally, to the online result calculation.
            Every vote is securely recorded, verified, and counted, ensuring no opportunity for manipulation.
        </p>
    </div>
